  "difficulty_reason": "Beyond ordinary graph-divisor, Dhar-burning and Abel–Jacobi prerequisites, the proof constructs unique degree-three divisor classes and proves their exact three-edge balance. It propagates cyclic orders and excludes incompatible class orderings by burning contradictions, identifies the harmonic quotient as a tree, and incorporates the official zero-three intraclass correction. This global divisor-to-automorphism construction is beyond ordinary doctoral combinatorics qualifiers.",
